[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to an Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR). This vulnerability arises because the API design relies on a token-based mechanism to authenticate and authorize access to service data, but there is no explicit mention of robust validation or verification of the token's authenticity or its association with the requesting user. If the token is predictable, improperly stored, or inadequately validated, an attacker could potentially use a valid token to gain unauthorized access to sensitive service information or manipulate service statuses, thereby compromising the confidentiality and integrity of the system.

